# HireMatch.AI

### Know exactly why you're not getting interviews.

AI-powered resume screener that scores your match, finds keyword gaps, rewrites your bullets, generates cover letters, and tracks every application — all in one place.

[![Live Demo](https://img.shields.io/badge/🚀_Live_Demo-hirematch--ai.vercel.app-7c6fff?style=for-the-badge)](https://hirematch-ai.vercel.app)
[![Made with Gemini](https://img.shields.io/badge/Gemini_2.0_Flash-AI_Powered-4285F4?style=for-the-badge&logo=google&logoColor=white)](https://aistudio.google.com)
[![Supabase](https://img.shields.io/badge/Supabase-Database_&_Auth-3ECF8E?style=for-the-badge&logo=supabase&logoColor=white)](https://supabase.com)
[![Vercel](https://img.shields.io/badge/Vercel-Deployed-000000?style=for-the-badge&logo=vercel&logoColor=white)](https://vercel.com)

</div>

---

## 🎯 The Problem

You apply to 50 jobs. You hear back from 3. You don't know why.

Most applicants never find out that ATS systems filter them out before a human even reads their resume — because of missing keywords, misaligned skills, or a cover letter that wasn't tailored.

**HireMatch.AI fixes that.**

---

## ✨ Features

| Feature | What it does |
|---|---|
| 🎯 **Match Score** | Scores your resume vs job description (0–100%) with animated visual |
| 🔍 **Keyword Gap Analysis** | Shows exactly which keywords are in your resume vs missing |
| 📊 **Skill Alignment** | Visual bars showing match strength per skill category |
| ✍️ **Resume Rewriter** | Paste any bullet point → get an ATS-optimised rewrite for that specific job |
| 📝 **Cover Letter Generator** | Full tailored cover letter referencing both your resume and the JD |
| 📁 **Application Tracker** | Every analysis saved — track status from Applied → Offered |
| ⚡ **Job Search Intelligence** | Patterns across all applications: which keywords keep blocking you, interview conversion rate, and more |

---

## 🛠 Tech Stack

```
Frontend      →  HTML + CSS + Vanilla JavaScript
AI Engine     →  Google Gemini 2.0 Flash (free tier)
Backend       →  Vercel Serverless Functions (Node.js)
Database      →  Supabase PostgreSQL
Auth          →  Supabase Auth (email/password)
PDF Parsing   →  PDF.js
Deployment    →  Vercel (auto-deploy from GitHub)
```

---

## 📁 Project Structure

```
hirematch-ai/
├── api/
│   └── analyze.js        # Serverless proxy → Gemini API
├── index.html            # Auth (sign in / sign up)
├── app.html              # Main analyser
├── tracker.html          # Application tracker dashboard
└── README.md
```

---

## ⚙️ Local Setup

### 1. Clone the repo
```bash
git clone https://github.com/Nion9/hirematch-ai.git
cd hirematch-ai
```

### 2. Set up Supabase
1. Create a project at [supabase.com](https://supabase.com)
2. Run `supabase-setup.sql` in the SQL Editor
3. Copy your **Project URL** and **anon public key**
4. Add them to `index.html`, `app.html`, and `tracker.html`:
```js
const SUPABASE_URL = 'your-project-url';
const SUPABASE_ANON_KEY = 'your-anon-key';
```

### 3. Get a Gemini API Key (free)
1. Go to [aistudio.google.com](https://aistudio.google.com)
2. Click **Get API Key** → **Create API Key**

### 4. Deploy to Vercel
1. Push to GitHub
2. Import repo at [vercel.com](https://vercel.com)
3. Add environment variable:
```
GEMINI_API_KEY = your-gemini-api-key
```
4. Deploy — done ✅

---

## 🔐 Security

- Supabase **Row Level Security (RLS)** ensures users only access their own data
- Gemini API key stored as Vercel environment variable — never exposed to client
- Supabase anon key is safe for frontend use by design

